🛒 Amazon Product Review Analysis & Customer Segmentation

Tech Stack: Python | SQL | Machine Learning | NLP | Time Series Analysis

Overview:
Analyzed Amazon product reviews and customer spending patterns to optimize inventory management and improve business strategy.

Key Highlights:

- Customer Segmentation: Grouped customers based on spending habits to identify the least active/high-risk segments for churn reduction and inventory optimization.
- Sentiment Analysis: Performed NLP-based analysis on product reviews to gauge customer satisfaction and product perception.
- Demand Forecasting: Applied time series analysis to predict future demand trends and support proactive inventory planning.
- Data Pipeline: Extracted, cleaned, and analyzed large datasets using Python and SQL for actionable insights.
- Machine Learning: Implemented clustering and predictive models to understand customer behavior and forecast future sales.

Impact:

- Improved inventory allocation efficiency by focusing on high-demand products.
- Identified at-risk customers for targeted retention strategies.
- Gained actionable insights from customer sentiment to guide product and marketing decisions.

